{"5093380": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Zombie Car: Kaiju Killer", "steam_appid": 5093380, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Turn your ride into an unstoppable weapon of mass destruction!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this action-packed incremental roguelite, the apocalypse is overrun by endless hordes of zombies—and colossal Kaiju monsters looming on the horizon. Your goal? Drive, smash, shoot, earn, and upgrade. Every run makes you stronger, richer, and better equipped to crush everything in your path. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5093380/extras/b3523208a81fcf29d57f230c8dbe2e6c.poster.avif?t=1788097667\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5093380/extras/b3523208a81fcf29d57f230c8dbe2e6c.webm?t=1788097667\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5093380/extras/b3523208a81fcf29d57f230c8dbe2e6c.mp4?t=1788097667\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >DRIVE, SMASH, AND DESTROY</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Plow through thousands of zombies using brute vehicle force, mounted machine guns, heavy missiles, and high-tech lasers. Feel the satisfaction of tearing through the horde as you turn carnage into cold, hard cash.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5093380/extras/a0e795db2a0de0b3b5609236211d8a74.poster.avif?t=1788097667\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5093380/extras/a0e795db2a0de0b3b5609236211d8a74.webm?t=1788097667\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5093380/extras/a0e795db2a0de0b3b5609236211d8a74.mp4?t=1788097667\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >INCREMENTAL PROGRESSION</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Smash, earn, upgrade, and repeat! Use the earnings from each run to boost your vehicle’s stats, purchase deadly weapon systems, increase fuel capacity, and unlock game-changing perks. Turn a rusty clunker into an armored juggernaut. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5093380/extras/26ef13db4c541b2d21dd19514e12d81e.poster.avif?t=1788097667\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5093380/extras/26ef13db4c541b2d21dd19514e12d81e.webm?t=1788097667\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5093380/extras/26ef13db4c541b2d21dd19514e12d81e.mp4?t=1788097667\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >FACE COLOSSAL KAIJU BOSSES</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Zombies are just the warm-up. The ultimate challenge awaits: giant, screen-shaking Kaiju bosses that require maxed-out firepower, perfect timing, and serious driving skills to defeat. Build the ultimate machine to take down city-crushing monsters!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5093380/extras/70ad7d5c0c5dedd7dd6741561e67c4df.poster.avif?t=1788097667\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5093380/extras/70ad7d5c0c5dedd7dd6741561e67c4df.webm?t=1788097667\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5093380/extras/70ad7d5c0c5dedd7dd6741561e67c4df.mp4?t=1788097667\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >KEY FEATURES</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Addictive Incremental Loop:</strong> Smash zombies -&gt; earn rewards -&gt; upgrade your rig -&gt; push further than ever before.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <strong>High-Octane Vehicle Combat:</strong> Equip machine guns, rocket launchers, lasers, and heavy rams. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Deep Upgrade System:</strong> Fine-tune fuel efficiency, armor, speed, weapon damage, ammo capacity, and special abilities.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Epic Boss Encounters:</strong> Build up your arsenal to take down massive Kaiju titans.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Fast-Paced &amp; Highly Replayable:</strong> Perfect for short, adrenaline-pumping play sessions or long, satisfying grind sessions. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Buckle up, hit the gas, and see how powerful you can make your ultimate war machine!</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Turn your ride into an unstoppable weapon of mass destruction!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this action-packed incremental roguelite, the apocalypse is overrun by endless hordes of zombies—and colossal Kaiju monsters looming on the horizon. Your goal? Drive, smash, shoot, earn, and upgrade. Every run makes you stronger, richer, and better equipped to crush everything in your path. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5093380/extras/b3523208a81fcf29d57f230c8dbe2e6c.poster.avif?t=1788097667\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5093380/extras/b3523208a81fcf29d57f230c8dbe2e6c.webm?t=1788097667\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5093380/extras/b3523208a81fcf29d57f230c8dbe2e6c.mp4?t=1788097667\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >DRIVE, SMASH, AND DESTROY</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Plow through thousands of zombies using brute vehicle force, mounted machine guns, heavy missiles, and high-tech lasers. Feel the satisfaction of tearing through the horde as you turn carnage into cold, hard cash.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5093380/extras/a0e795db2a0de0b3b5609236211d8a74.poster.avif?t=1788097667\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5093380/extras/a0e795db2a0de0b3b5609236211d8a74.webm?t=1788097667\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5093380/extras/a0e795db2a0de0b3b5609236211d8a74.mp4?t=1788097667\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >INCREMENTAL PROGRESSION</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Smash, earn, upgrade, and repeat! Use the earnings from each run to boost your vehicle’s stats, purchase deadly weapon systems, increase fuel capacity, and unlock game-changing perks. Turn a rusty clunker into an armored juggernaut. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5093380/extras/26ef13db4c541b2d21dd19514e12d81e.poster.avif?t=1788097667\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5093380/extras/26ef13db4c541b2d21dd19514e12d81e.webm?t=1788097667\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5093380/extras/26ef13db4c541b2d21dd19514e12d81e.mp4?t=1788097667\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >FACE COLOSSAL KAIJU BOSSES</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Zombies are just the warm-up. The ultimate challenge awaits: giant, screen-shaking Kaiju bosses that require maxed-out firepower, perfect timing, and serious driving skills to defeat. Build the ultimate machine to take down city-crushing monsters!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5093380/extras/70ad7d5c0c5dedd7dd6741561e67c4df.poster.avif?t=1788097667\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5093380/extras/70ad7d5c0c5dedd7dd6741561e67c4df.webm?t=1788097667\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5093380/extras/70ad7d5c0c5dedd7dd6741561e67c4df.mp4?t=1788097667\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >KEY FEATURES</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Addictive Incremental Loop:</strong> Smash zombies -&gt; earn rewards -&gt; upgrade your rig -&gt; push further than ever before.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <strong>High-Octane Vehicle Combat:</strong> Equip machine guns, rocket launchers, lasers, and heavy rams. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Deep Upgrade System:</strong> Fine-tune fuel efficiency, armor, speed, weapon damage, ammo capacity, and special abilities.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Epic Boss Encounters:</strong> Build up your arsenal to take down massive Kaiju titans.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Fast-Paced &amp; Highly Replayable:</strong> Perfect for short, adrenaline-pumping play sessions or long, satisfying grind sessions. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Buckle up, hit the gas, and see how powerful you can make your ultimate war machine!</p>", "short_description": "Mow down relentless zombie hordes, turn carnage into cash, and upgrade your war rig into an unstoppable death machine! In this action-packed incremental roguelite, every run brings you closer to facing colossal Kaiju bosses. Gear up, smash through, and dominate!", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5093380/6382747e556497be51bb3bb9dc90fda6c6c8ad86/header.jpg?t=1788097667", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5093380/a586f28084c75840791e8de020cc063e20867cef/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1788097667", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5093380/a586f28084c75840791e8de020cc063e20867cef/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1788097667", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10 (64-bit)<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i3-4130 / AMD FX-4300 (or equivalent CPU)<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Intel UHD Graphics 620 / NVIDIA GeForce GT 730 (2 GB) / AMD Radeon R7 240<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 11<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 500 MB available space<br></li><li><strong>Additional Notes:</strong> PSX-style graphics optimized for low-end hardware and integrated GPUs.</li></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10 / 11 (64-bit)<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i3-10100 / AMD Ryzen 3 3100<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVIDIA 